WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
Final Episode

00:00.000 --> 00:00.030
- Final Episode
- Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:00.033 --> 00:02.399
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:15.040 --> 00:16.040
Chikane-chan!

00:27.860 --> 00:29.450
Chikane-chan!!

00:55.870 --> 00:59.935
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

00:59.936 --> 01:03.999
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:04.000 --> 01:07.065
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:07.066 --> 01:10.129
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:10.130 --> 01:12.260
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:12.890 --> 01:14.660
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:14.661 --> 01:16.429
Surely my existence is here now

01:16.430 --> 01:18.140
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:18.143 --> 01:19.475
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:19.476 --> 01:20.809
There's no more tears to cry

01:20.810 --> 01:22.935
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:22.936 --> 01:25.060
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:25.520 --> 01:27.670
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:27.671 --> 01:29.820
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:30.030 --> 01:32.470
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:32.471 --> 01:34.909
Flowing towards the other side of time,

01:34.910 --> 01:37.245
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

01:37.246 --> 01:39.580
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

01:39.870 --> 01:42.060
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

01:42.061 --> 01:44.249
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

01:44.250 --> 01:48.545
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

01:48.546 --> 01:52.840
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:12.630 --> 02:14.259
Chikane-chan...

02:14.260 --> 02:15.460
What have I...

02:15.800 --> 02:17.080
done to Chikane-chan?

02:23.570 --> 02:25.450
Stop, Himeko.

02:27.160 --> 02:28.470
Please.

02:29.710 --> 02:31.110
Chikane-chan...

02:31.850 --> 02:33.100
This is fine.

02:33.410 --> 02:35.460
I can finally...

02:36.280 --> 02:40.010
reveal my truth to you.

02:45.160 --> 02:48.640
This is... us, right?

02:49.060 --> 02:52.649
Yes, as Solar Priestess
and Lunar Priestess...

02:52.650 --> 02:56.240
fighting Eight-headed
Orochi in our previous lives.

02:56.740 --> 02:59.650
I remember too, Chikane-chan.

03:04.580 --> 03:08.659
Our duty was to become Ame
no Murakumo's power...

03:08.660 --> 03:10.160
and defeat Orochi.

03:10.450 --> 03:12.239
Then seal Orochi...

03:12.240 --> 03:15.170
and restore the destroyed
world to its original form.

03:15.890 --> 03:17.169
Right?

03:17.170 --> 03:19.170
Yes, and for that...

03:23.930 --> 03:27.040
The two priestesses' last
ritual to seal Orochi...

03:27.330 --> 03:32.350
with Ame no Murakumo and return
the world to its prior form.

03:32.770 --> 03:33.770
That was...

03:40.280 --> 03:43.570
to sacrifice one priestess's
life by the other's hand.

03:44.350 --> 03:48.959
By offering a priestess's
existence to revive the world.

03:48.960 --> 03:49.960
That's right.

03:50.320 --> 03:52.810
I killed you with these hands.

03:53.360 --> 03:56.340
A sin buried deep in my memory.

03:56.580 --> 04:00.340
But even if that memory was
lost, the pain from it...

04:01.000 --> 04:03.780
had always bothered me.

04:05.970 --> 04:09.180
At that moment, I remembered why.

04:12.810 --> 04:15.779
That's why Ame no Murakumo didn't revive.

04:15.780 --> 04:19.149
No matter how we wished,
I, who killed you...

04:19.150 --> 04:23.360
hated Ame no Murakumo
somewhere in my heart.

04:23.570 --> 04:24.759
No.

04:24.760 --> 04:26.370
Chikane-chan, no.

04:26.830 --> 04:28.829
You're not at fault.

04:28.830 --> 04:30.060
I...

04:30.700 --> 04:33.250
I can't forgive myself.

04:33.500 --> 04:36.599
If you're with me, you won't win.

04:36.600 --> 04:37.600
So...

04:37.720 --> 04:40.760
So you became a member of the Orochi?

04:41.340 --> 04:43.760
You did that for me?

04:44.140 --> 04:47.449
I had to make you hate me.

04:47.450 --> 04:49.760
I had to become your enemy.

04:50.350 --> 04:52.260
Even if that meant utilizing Orochi.

04:53.730 --> 04:55.770
So that you could kill me.

04:56.720 --> 04:59.159
I wanted you to hate me.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.270
Chikane-chan.

05:00.660 --> 05:03.059
Now the world will be restored.

05:03.060 --> 05:05.499
The village, the school, everyone...

05:05.500 --> 05:07.780
will return to a world without Orochi.

05:08.340 --> 05:11.169
But in that world, you'll...

05:11.170 --> 05:12.290
You'll...

05:12.450 --> 05:15.209
Yes, I'll disappear.

05:15.210 --> 05:18.290
Himemiya Chikane won't exist.

05:18.460 --> 05:21.300
No! I... I don't want that!

05:22.050 --> 05:23.499
It'll be fine.

05:23.500 --> 05:28.300
Saotome-san and Oogami-kun
will always be with you.

05:32.260 --> 05:35.020
Find happiness, Himeko.

05:35.700 --> 05:36.770
Wait.

05:37.130 --> 05:41.270
Chikane-chan, I still have
to get an answer from you.

05:42.570 --> 05:43.570
Answer?

05:43.670 --> 05:46.280
You said you like me.

05:46.870 --> 05:49.280
That you love me, right?

05:49.780 --> 05:51.679
Was that also...

05:51.680 --> 05:52.680
a lie?

05:54.050 --> 05:56.450
Was that all an act?

05:57.050 --> 05:58.500
Tell me, Chikane-chan!

06:01.520 --> 06:02.750
It's true.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.710
I've always loved you.

06:07.420 --> 06:11.470
But my love is different from your love.

06:12.170 --> 06:15.600
You were my number one, a real princess...

06:16.020 --> 06:18.560
and the sun that gently shone upon me.

06:20.570 --> 06:23.650
The moon is able to shine
because of the sun.

06:24.200 --> 06:27.940
I wished to be fairer and
brighter than anyone.

06:28.820 --> 06:31.780
I just wanted you to see.

06:32.590 --> 06:35.310
I shouldn't say these things.

06:35.960 --> 06:39.670
I decided to keep it to myself.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.790
I'm sorry, Himeko.

06:42.160 --> 06:44.420
Me too, Chikane-chan.

06:45.630 --> 06:48.470
I love you, too.

06:50.000 --> 06:51.000
Thank you.

06:51.740 --> 06:53.969
Because you're kind...

06:53.970 --> 06:55.909
So kind...

06:55.910 --> 06:58.980
I was hoping you would say that.

06:59.910 --> 07:01.140
But...

07:01.900 --> 07:02.980
That's not true.

07:04.360 --> 07:07.209
See? It's pounding, right?

07:07.210 --> 07:09.299
Just like with Souma-kun.

07:09.300 --> 07:11.860
No, even more than that.

07:12.100 --> 07:16.970
Now I know why I cried
when I kissed Souma-kun.

07:17.460 --> 07:19.260
Because it was the same love.

07:20.300 --> 07:23.850
My love was the same as yours.

07:24.380 --> 07:26.139
That's why I was sad.

07:26.140 --> 07:27.970
No, Himeko.

07:29.040 --> 07:32.949
I'm not as great as you think I am.

07:32.950 --> 07:36.470
I'm weak and a liar, and I'm
sure you're disappointed.

07:36.820 --> 07:38.979
I'm not disappointed.

07:38.980 --> 07:41.940
I want to embrace you and kiss you.

07:42.460 --> 07:44.980
Even though I'm a girl...

07:45.430 --> 07:47.480
If it's with you, then I want it too...

07:48.050 --> 07:53.490
I've hurt you and done such...
such horrible things.

07:53.970 --> 07:56.240
I don't mind.

07:56.770 --> 07:59.410
No, I killed you.

07:59.710 --> 08:00.790
I killed you.

08:01.310 --> 08:05.790
A person like me shouldn't love
you, shouldn't be loved by you.

08:06.480 --> 08:08.800
I shouldn't be forgiven.

08:09.240 --> 08:11.140
I... I'm...

08:21.680 --> 08:24.270
Chikane-chan, I finally understood.

08:24.770 --> 08:27.270
You aren't an angel or a devil.

08:27.630 --> 08:31.709
You were excited just to pass
by the person you loved...

08:31.710 --> 08:34.280
just to talk to the person you loved.

08:34.610 --> 08:38.930
But just thinking of being hated
worried you on sleepless nights.

08:39.250 --> 08:42.790
You were a 16-year-old girl like me.

08:43.080 --> 08:45.920
Yet I didn't think about that at all.

08:46.850 --> 08:49.819
Because you're strong and kind...

08:49.820 --> 08:54.010
I just had you support me,
relied on you, and all selfishly.

08:54.260 --> 08:58.069
It was hard and sad, but
you put up with it.

08:58.070 --> 09:01.399
You gave up everything
you treasured and loved.

09:01.400 --> 09:04.019
Even though you suffered the most...

09:04.020 --> 09:08.709
I left you all alone, didn't I?

09:08.710 --> 09:09.710
I'm sorry.

09:10.140 --> 09:12.899
Don't bear things for me anymore!

09:12.900 --> 09:16.540
Share your pain, suffering,
anything with me!

09:17.220 --> 09:21.540
If I'm with you, I'll be fine no
matter what. I'll do my best!

09:21.730 --> 09:25.029
The sun shines because of the moon.

09:25.030 --> 09:27.429
It can smile. It can cheer up.

09:27.430 --> 09:30.040
The moon teaches the sun how to shine...

09:30.560 --> 09:33.410
so that it can work
harder to shine brighter.

09:33.870 --> 09:35.449
For the moon.

09:35.450 --> 09:39.009
I want to become your very own Himeko...

09:39.010 --> 09:41.379
who'll always shine on the moon.

09:41.380 --> 09:42.380
Himeko...

09:45.610 --> 09:48.080
Happy birthday, Chikane-chan.

09:56.020 --> 09:57.479
Himeko!

09:57.480 --> 10:00.090
I love you, Chikane-chan.

10:02.530 --> 10:06.089
I can say it in front of anyone.
I'm not ashamed.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.100
It's true.

10:10.540 --> 10:12.590
I love you, Chikane-chan.

10:29.660 --> 10:31.189
Let's go, Himeko.

10:31.190 --> 10:32.650
Right, Chikane-chan.

10:45.440 --> 10:47.100
Souma.

10:47.440 --> 10:48.970
Souma.

10:49.680 --> 10:51.909
Tsubasa-niisan.

10:51.910 --> 10:56.099
Is that the outcome of fighting
for the girl you love?

10:56.100 --> 11:00.930
Protecting her got you like
that, and what was her choice?

11:01.420 --> 11:02.969
Satisfied?

11:02.970 --> 11:05.859
Still say that the world isn't hell?

11:05.860 --> 11:06.860
Yeah.

11:07.330 --> 11:08.389
Why?

11:08.390 --> 11:10.359
Himeko's alive.

11:10.360 --> 11:13.110
That's enough. I don't have any regrets.

11:14.600 --> 11:18.969
Although you haven't gained a thing?
You're such an idiot.

11:18.970 --> 11:25.130
You also sacrificed
everything to protect me.

11:28.820 --> 11:31.829
You're truly my little brother.

11:31.830 --> 11:33.350
You fool!

11:38.440 --> 11:43.720
You miserable brother, I'll let you
be a fool till the end at least.

12:00.080 --> 12:02.840
Himeko!

12:14.930 --> 12:16.459
Himeko.

12:16.460 --> 12:18.880
Souma-kun! You're all right?

12:19.430 --> 12:20.500
Yeah.

12:21.570 --> 12:22.880
I promised, right?

12:24.000 --> 12:25.940
Can I help, too?

12:26.720 --> 12:33.889
The least I can do is save the Earth, but I
want to draw the final line for you two.

12:33.890 --> 12:35.319
Souma-kun.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.919
You want to talk alone, right?

12:37.920 --> 12:39.849
Do as you wish.

12:39.850 --> 12:41.400
Thank you, Souma-kun.

12:41.820 --> 12:43.070
Please.

12:56.240 --> 13:02.050
Sparkling Solar Wave of
Ultimate Destruction!

13:13.250 --> 13:15.450
Are you satisfied?

13:16.760 --> 13:19.290
Thank you, Tsubasa-niisan.

13:20.390 --> 13:21.520
Fool.

13:22.300 --> 13:23.530
Tsubasa-niisan?

13:23.740 --> 13:25.869
Become strong, Souma.

13:25.870 --> 13:28.029
So you can fight alone.

13:28.030 --> 13:30.860
So you can protect what's important.

13:31.300 --> 13:32.740
Be strong.

13:35.810 --> 13:38.980
Thank you, Tsubasa-niisan.

13:53.560 --> 13:56.529
It's over, Chikane-chan.

13:56.530 --> 13:58.600
You're right, Himeko.

14:00.130 --> 14:02.190
Oh, let's take a picture together.

14:02.720 --> 14:04.200
Here I go!

14:18.120 --> 14:19.649
It came out nice.

14:19.650 --> 14:21.170
Yes, very.

14:24.420 --> 14:25.959
Chikane-chan?

14:25.960 --> 14:29.090
I'm sorry. I keep crying, don't I?

14:30.900 --> 14:35.180
I think it's okay to cry. I'll
become your handkerchief.

14:36.700 --> 14:39.190
How great. The sun's handkerchief.

14:41.780 --> 14:45.409
Nice weather. We should go
out on a day like this.

14:45.410 --> 14:48.449
You're right. Where do you want to go?

14:48.450 --> 14:52.950
Let's see... I want to see that puppy.

14:53.390 --> 14:57.689
That sounds good. I wonder
if that puppy has grown.

14:57.690 --> 15:01.460
He brought us together, right?

15:02.030 --> 15:04.159
We'll thank him a lot.

15:04.160 --> 15:04.890
Yes.

15:04.891 --> 15:08.470
We need to dress up. Will
you do my hair again?

15:09.100 --> 15:10.090
Of course.

15:10.091 --> 15:13.609
I want to wear matching clothes, too.

15:13.610 --> 15:18.100
Oh, but if you dress like me,
you might look a bit childish.

15:18.780 --> 15:21.100
No, it's a great idea.

15:21.510 --> 15:27.089
Not just clothes, but also ribbons,
shoes, purses, and accessories.

15:27.090 --> 15:32.489
I'll choose them all for you.
I'll make a delicious lunch, too.

15:32.490 --> 15:35.859
I'll learn to make omelets
from Otoha-san so good...

15:35.860 --> 15:38.249
that you'll be surprised.

15:38.250 --> 15:39.250
So good...

15:39.700 --> 15:40.930
Himeko.

15:42.170 --> 15:44.900
Why can't I be with you?

15:45.310 --> 15:48.300
When I love you so much?

15:48.610 --> 15:49.480
Himeko.

15:49.481 --> 15:53.800
When the album still has
so many pages left.

15:54.310 --> 15:58.080
When I want to fill it with memories of us.

15:58.790 --> 16:01.770
When I haven't done anything yet.

16:02.390 --> 16:05.270
Nothing for you.

16:06.390 --> 16:08.650
Yet why?

16:09.830 --> 16:13.530
Because we're priestesses
of the godless month.

16:14.130 --> 16:17.820
To end the misfortune of
Orochi of the godless moon...

16:18.200 --> 16:22.420
the proper world is restored
in exchange for our lives and feelings.

16:23.510 --> 16:26.779
Just as you did.

16:26.780 --> 16:29.050
That's so cruel.

16:29.580 --> 16:32.419
I don't want to forget anymore.

16:32.420 --> 16:36.050
I don't want to forget this
feeling of loving you.

16:36.390 --> 16:38.829
Me neither, Himeko.

16:38.830 --> 16:40.060
I won't forget.

16:40.630 --> 16:46.060
I won't be beaten by eternity,
fate, or even God. I won't lose!

16:46.470 --> 16:49.570
Because our feelings are connected.

16:50.900 --> 16:52.070
Himeko.

16:52.340 --> 16:54.909
Right, Chikane-chan?

16:54.910 --> 16:57.570
Right, Himeko. It's the same for me.

16:57.980 --> 17:00.720
It's a promise, Chikane-chan.

17:01.040 --> 17:04.300
Yes, it's a promise, Himeko.

17:15.730 --> 17:16.899
Chikane-chan!

17:16.900 --> 17:18.290
Himeko...

17:19.070 --> 17:20.000
Chikane-chan!

17:20.000 --> 17:20.430
Himeko!

17:20.640 --> 17:22.799
I don't want to part, Chikane-chan!

17:22.800 --> 17:23.930
I don't!

17:24.170 --> 17:25.469
Himeko...

17:25.470 --> 17:26.470
Himeko!

17:28.620 --> 17:31.339
Himeko, I'll be reborn.

17:31.340 --> 17:33.570
I'll come back, so find me!

17:33.750 --> 17:35.379
Find me.

17:35.380 --> 17:37.949
You must, Himeko! You must! You must!

17:37.950 --> 17:40.189
I won't forget! Ever!

17:40.190 --> 17:42.449
Looks and memories won't matter!

17:42.450 --> 17:46.329
I'll know! I'll definitely find you!

17:46.330 --> 17:47.960
I'll definitely find you!

17:56.470 --> 17:59.369
I will not ask for forgiveness.

17:59.370 --> 18:02.640
Will you lament your fate, Lunar Priestess?

18:04.770 --> 18:07.109
Do you wish the void's peace...

18:07.110 --> 18:10.510
over the everlasting cycle of partings?

18:11.720 --> 18:14.549
I met Himeko again.

18:14.550 --> 18:16.280
So I'm happy now.

18:16.890 --> 18:18.280
More than anyone.

18:32.370 --> 18:33.370
Himeko...

18:36.280 --> 18:37.639
On the moon...

18:37.640 --> 18:40.160
there's an abandoned
shrine no one knows about.

19:03.370 --> 19:04.590
Himeko.

19:06.210 --> 19:07.390
Himeko!

19:07.790 --> 19:09.779
Hey, wake up!

19:09.780 --> 19:11.690
Hi-me-ko!

19:14.840 --> 19:17.180
Good, you woke up nicely.

19:18.520 --> 19:21.340
Yup, 16 seconds faster than yesterday.

19:22.460 --> 19:26.580
Let's see... Who has today's morning duty?

19:30.830 --> 19:32.850
C'mon. Hurry, hurry.

19:34.170 --> 19:35.759
Sorry, Mako-chan.

19:35.760 --> 19:37.360
Kurusugawa.

19:39.120 --> 19:40.609
Oogami-kun.

19:40.610 --> 19:42.070
Oh, the prince.

19:42.810 --> 19:47.979
Tomorrow's your birthday, right?
Can we meet? Um, I'd like to talk.

19:47.980 --> 19:49.210
With me?

19:51.150 --> 19:54.770
I like you, Kurusugawa. I
want to protect you forever.

19:55.760 --> 19:57.210
Will you go out with me?

20:00.990 --> 20:03.930
I have a person I want to wait for.

20:05.350 --> 20:07.129
I don't know who...

20:07.130 --> 20:11.900
but it's someone in this world
who's waiting just for me.

20:12.210 --> 20:13.569
You don't know?

20:13.570 --> 20:16.909
But I believe we can meet someday.

20:16.910 --> 20:18.610
That we will meet.

20:18.820 --> 20:22.110
So I want to wait for that person.

20:24.520 --> 20:26.249
Sorry, Oogami-kun.

20:26.250 --> 20:27.549
I'm...

20:27.550 --> 20:29.119
It's okay.

20:29.120 --> 20:32.920
I can't ask for more when
you have that expression.

20:34.060 --> 20:35.130
Oogami-kun...

20:35.530 --> 20:38.720
I hope you meet that important person.

20:39.770 --> 20:41.590
See you at school.

20:42.840 --> 20:44.130
Oogami-kun!

20:44.740 --> 20:46.830
See you, Oogami-kun!

20:48.570 --> 20:54.149
Life is short.

20:54.150 --> 20:58.550
Hey, boy, fall in love.

21:00.920 --> 21:01.990
Souma.

21:14.330 --> 21:17.419
This is the village of Mahoroba.

21:17.420 --> 21:21.160
In this village, time slowly passes by.

21:22.340 --> 21:23.420
People, too.

21:23.620 --> 21:25.039
Nature, too.

21:25.040 --> 21:26.440
Everything.

21:28.650 --> 21:29.930
Rejected him?

21:30.420 --> 21:31.920
Because I...

21:32.720 --> 21:37.359
You're the biggest idiot. How
can you reject the prince?

21:37.360 --> 21:40.440
Is an imaginary person that important?

21:43.060 --> 21:46.450
Oh, fine. Don't say any more.

21:46.670 --> 21:49.570
You love me that much? Is that it?

21:50.160 --> 21:51.410
Himeko, I love you!

21:51.840 --> 21:53.450
Stop! No!

21:53.870 --> 21:55.460
No kissing!

21:58.780 --> 22:00.000
What's wrong?

22:02.880 --> 22:04.340
This page...

22:04.750 --> 22:06.980
only has pictures of you.

22:08.680 --> 22:09.680
Himeko...

22:10.220 --> 22:12.289
What's wrong, Himeko?

22:12.290 --> 22:13.600
I don't know.

22:14.960 --> 22:17.999
Looking at these pictures
makes my heart ache.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.480
I wonder why.

22:19.790 --> 22:23.110
It's very nostalgic and very painful...

22:23.440 --> 22:24.660
Himeko...

22:25.140 --> 22:26.570
I'm fine.

22:27.370 --> 22:28.639
I...

22:28.640 --> 22:31.070
I'll be fine.

22:31.710 --> 22:33.609
Many fortunate things...

22:33.610 --> 22:37.320
and unfortunate things get
woven together and repeated.

22:37.950 --> 22:42.580
But still, there's one certain
thing inside me that won't change.

22:43.190 --> 22:45.280
How I feel.

24:00.430 --> 24:04.929
We fall in love all over again.
